-- **The base a block of `Pins` holds** (MS11 phase 300, his ruling of
-- 2026-11-06). `answer` is a clause `Pins` also has, so what the block settles
-- is which of the two is tried first; `stumbles` is one that fails, so that
-- what the pool looks like after a body that never reached its pop can be
-- measured.
rule base quiet where

rule answer :- do
  say "quiet"

rule stumbles :- do
  pop-development
